# Dashboard Modernization & Restructuring Plan

## Goal
Completely restructure and modernize the GHG Emissions Dashboard with a premium, data-rich design that improves visual hierarchy, chart readability, and overall user experience.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Layout Changes**: The dashboard grid structure will be completely redesigned with a new 3-column layout that better balances content and improves visual flow.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Chart Enhancements**: All charts will be upgraded with better styling, animations, and interactive features including tooltips and hover effects.

> [!WARNING]
> **Breaking Visual Changes**: The current card positions and sizes will change significantly. The new layout prioritizes:
> - Hero metrics at the top (full width)
> - Main trend chart prominently in the center-left
> - Doughnut charts side-by-side in a dedicated row
> - Detailed breakdown table spanning full width at bottom

## Proposed Changes

### Layout Restructuring

#### New Grid Structure
**Current**: Mixed grid with inconsistent row heights and card sizes
**New**: Clean 3-column grid with defined sections:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Hero Metrics (Full Width)                              │
│  - Total Emissions, CH4, Scope 1/2                      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌──────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────┐
│  Categorical Overview        │  Reference Libraries     │
│  (Activity/Division Cards)   │  (Compact)               │
└──────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────┘
┌──────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────┐
│  Emissions Over Time         │  Quick Data Entry        │
│  (Large Trend Chart)         │  (Shortcuts)             │
└──────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────┘
┌─────────────┬─────────────┬──────────────────────────┐
│  Activity   │  Source     │  Detailed Breakdown      │
│  Doughnut   │  Doughnut   │  (Table)                 │
└─────────────┴─────────────┴──────────────────────────┘
```

---

### Chart Modernization

#### [MODIFY] Emissions Over Time (Trend Chart)
**Enhancements**:
- Gradient fills under line charts for visual depth
- Animated line drawing on load
- Interactive tooltips with formatted values
- Grid lines with subtle opacity
- Responsive legend with toggle functionality
- Add area chart option for better visual impact

#### [MODIFY] Activity & Source Doughnut Charts
**Enhancements**:
- Increase cutout to 75% for modern look
- Add center text showing total value
- Animated segment drawing
- Hover effects with segment expansion
- Better color palette with gradients
- Compact legends below charts

#### [NEW] Mini Sparkline Charts
Add small sparkline charts to hero metrics showing:
- 12-month trend for Total Emissions
- 12-month trend for CH4
- Visual indicators for goal progress

---

### Visual Enhancements

#### Card Styling
- Add subtle shadows with `box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)`
- Implement glassmorphism effects on hover
- Add border accent colors for different card types
- Smooth transitions on all interactive elements

#### Color Palette Refinement
**Current**: Basic colors
**New**: Premium gradient-based palette
- Primary: `#10b981` → Gradient to `#059669`
- Accent: `#f59e0b` → Gradient to `#d97706`
- Scope 1: `#10b981` with glow effect
- Scope 2: `#6366f1` with glow effect
- Background cards: `rgba(255,255,255,0.03)` → `rgba(255,255,255,0.05)`

#### Typography
- Increase contrast for better readability
- Use font weights more strategically (600 for headers, 400 for body)
- Add letter-spacing to uppercase labels

