## Verification Plan

### Visual Testing
1. **Layout Verification**:
   - Check all cards align properly in new grid
   - Verify responsive behavior on different screen sizes
   - Ensure no overflow or misalignment

2. **Chart Functionality**:
   - Test all chart interactions (hover, click, legend toggle)
   - Verify animations play smoothly
   - Check tooltip formatting and positioning

3. **Performance**:
   - Ensure smooth animations (60fps)
   - Check load times with real data
   - Verify no layout shifts during data loading

### Browser Testing
- Test in Chrome (primary)
- Verify in Firefox
- Check in Edge

### Data Validation
- Confirm all data displays correctly in new layout
- Verify filter functionality still works
- Check year selection updates all charts
